{"id": "EUVD-2026-39848", "enisaUuid": "c55a075c-7a0b-3bf2-8142-417544ae835c", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Avoid NULL dereference in dc_dmub_srv error paths\n\nIn dc_dmub_srv_log_diagnostic_data() and\ndc_dmub_srv_enable_dpia_trace().\n\nBoth functions check:\n\n  if (!dc_dmub_srv || !dc_dmub_srv->dmub)\n\nand then call DC_LOG_ERROR() inside that block.\n\nDC_LOG_ERROR() uses dc_dmub_srv->ctx internally. So if\ndc_dmub_srv is NULL, the logging itself can dereference a\nNULL pointer and cause a crash.\n\nFix this by splitting the checks.\n\nFirst check if dc_dmub_srv is NULL and return immediately.\nThen check dc_dmub_srv->dmub and log the error only when\ndc_dmub_srv is valid.\n\nFixes the below:\n../display/dc/dc_dmub_srv.c:962 dc_dmub_srv_log_diagnostic_data() error: we previously assumed 'dc_dmub_srv' could be null (see line 961)\n../display/dc/dc_dmub_srv.c:1167 dc_dmub_srv_enable_dpia_trace() error: we previously assumed 'dc_dmub_srv' could be null (see line 1166)", "datePublished": "2026-06-26T19:41:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:42:29", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1cad9afbb2d559b738b83c498f9c1abdfd327e7f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a71fdbd6e8289e2725d33a9873833459f3b1824f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2ab18de5ebb11c76bfc8087c5a09fbcccd0dea8a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b37a978e6d8c33fbfa4abc5dcca4c7cfc6d01f22", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4ae3e16f4b3bf64140f773629b765d605ee079a9"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2885-rcqv-3jp6", "CVE-2026-53313"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "22e023e3-5e40-3f95-9cb8-cae8daa6bde0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.0.10"}, {"id": "36125cc3-0043-3627-98f4-fe1bcb66992c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "4466a243-41a4-3d38-a115-8b0e5e05cdf7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2631ac1ac328189031d1aefbbd4929050f72fb23 <1cad9afbb2d559b738b83c498f9c1abdfd327e7f"}, {"id": "44dab974-6883-3457-8ea4-358b9c0bec91", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2631ac1ac328189031d1aefbbd4929050f72fb23 <b37a978e6d8c33fbfa4abc5dcca4c7cfc6d01f22"}, {"id": "629dda2c-4e57-3188-9a2a-51faf2cbee67", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1"}, {"id": "73db49d7-eadc-3c55-9a92-90d9d6eb6f57", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "798c14a4-0528-3f00-9303-e3261452dc6c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2631ac1ac328189031d1aefbbd4929050f72fb23 <a71fdbd6e8289e2725d33a9873833459f3b1824f"}, {"id": "7d8a3b75-8487-39e3-8be5-7b50b9611f61", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2631ac1ac328189031d1aefbbd4929050f72fb23 <4ae3e16f4b3bf64140f773629b765d605ee079a9"}, {"id": "b4d6ad35-f2a0-324c-a84c-8be9b6fded82", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.109"}, {"id": "d0c2523c-123f-3424-8058-3a0537f84bb7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.14"}, {"id": "ed6e4776-3309-385f-892a-d0a4d3da1e81", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2631ac1ac328189031d1aefbbd4929050f72fb23 <2ab18de5ebb11c76bfc8087c5a09fbcccd0dea8a"}, {"id": "f4e3734c-1aa5-3fd1-9222-3dd732391aee", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "395970d3-0aca-37e2-9469-796e87db5b61", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}